Infra Arcana: controls
======================

The game's own keys, as in its manual (manual.txt in this drawer, or ?
in the game). Options (=) changes them; they are kept in the drawer's
User drawer.

Moving
  Numeric keypad     move in eight directions; 5 waits a turn
  Cursor keys        move; Shift + left/right moves up left/right,
                     Ctrl + left/right moves down left/right
  Shift + move       run until something happens
  . (full stop)      wait a turn

The most used
  i                  inventory          a   use or drink
  f                  aim and fire       r   reload
  g or ,             pick up            t   throw
  k or w             kick               x   cast a spell
  c                  close a door       v   look
  m                  map                Tab melee the nearest monster
  Esc                the in-game menu, or back
  Return             choose in a menu   Space  go on
  ?                  the manual         =   options
  Q                  quit (the game is saved when you leave by the menu)

The A1200 and A600 keyboards have no keypad: the cursor keys and Shift or
Ctrl do the diagonals.
